Cell["\<\
The left and right interface factors use the same complex energy. \
Consequently, they are generally not conjugate transposes of one another at \
nonreal energy.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1831825485,ExpressionUUID->"23e0d186-10c7-4746-b0b5-b75bb67e69bd"],

